---
<Layout title="Admissions Coaching" description="Time-bounded admissions coaching for UK undergraduate and medical school, US medical school, and graduate applicants. Strategy, statements, and interview preparation.">
  <PageIntro eyebrow="Admissions / Coaching" title="A clear voice.<br />A considered application." description="Premium, time-bounded support for applicants approaching or navigating an application cycle. Rigorous preparation, with your ideas at the centre." />
  <div class="container">
    <section class="split-content"><h2>Where we can work.</h2><div><div class="tags"><span class="tag">UK undergraduate admissions</span><span class="tag">UK medical school admissions</span><span class="tag">US medical school admissions</span><span class="tag">Graduate school admissions</span></div><ul><li>Personal statement strategy and application positioning</li><li>Interview preparation and mock interviews</li><li>MMI preparation where relevant</li><li>Structured reflection on your experiences and goals</li></ul></div></section>
    <section class="split-content"><h2>Structured support.</h2><div><p>Live consultations create space for discussion and practice. Asynchronous feedback supports reflection and revision between sessions. The timeline, deliverables, editing boundaries, and amount of feedback are agreed before payment.</p><p>All writing and experiences must be your own. Coaching does not include ghostwriting or any guarantee of admission.</p></div></section>
    <section class="split-content"><div><span class="eyebrow">An indicative package</span><h2 style="margin-top:18px">UCAS Personal<br />Statement Crafting</h2></div><div><p>Four structured sessions at <strong>SGD 100 per session</strong>.</p><h3>Indicative total: SGD 400.</h3><p style="margin-top:20px">This is one example, not a universal package price. Work follows the current UCAS statement format. The scope of included editing and asynchronous feedback will be made clear before accepting payment; additional work is not assumed to be included.</p><a class="button" href="/admissions/book/">Enquire about coaching <span aria-hidden="true"><svg class="arrow" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 13L13 3M3 3H13V13" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" /></svg></span></a></div></section>
  </div>
</Layout>
